  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEstimate the quotient, and then check your estimate on your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"52\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image023.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind \"compatible numbers\" to round off to.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eIn this case, rather than trying to round to the nearest one or ten, we want to find two close numbers which are easy to divide.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e37 is close to 40, and \u003cimg width\u003d\"21\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image024.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e is close to \u003cimg width\u003d\"21\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image025.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e or \u003cimg width\u003d\"16\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image011.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"111\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image026.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"47\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image027.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e is the same as 40 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18201\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 2, or 80.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCheck using your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCheck using your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18202\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18203\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18204\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdiv.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18204\u0026quot;,134)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18205\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18206\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18206\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18207\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18208\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q6.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18209\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18209\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the value\u003cimg width\u003d\"33\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/image028.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e, close to our estimate.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_8_40/f-40-8-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
